{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559550/extras/Image.JPG?t=1733400433\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a small notebook, an abandoned character was drawn without any story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For a long time, the character lived lonely and trapped in the notebook, but one day, the character gathered courage and decided to escape the notebook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid the various backgrounds drawn on the note and obstacles that hinder the character and advance towards the end of this note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Gameplay</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are various backgrounds drawn on the note that look like they were drawn by a person. Climb up and avoid the background with simple but challenging controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>-Be prepared for the dangers of various traps!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many traps hidden throughout the beautiful-looking background that can hinder the characters. If you don't avoid the trap, there's no guarantee what the consequences will be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>-Choose where you land carefully!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All objects interact with the character. Find a place for your character to rest in the bouncy background!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf High risk, high return </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf All progress is automatically saved </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Repetitive play </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Various gimmicks that harass players </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Unique graphic background </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Simple operation </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559550/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1733400433\" /><i>Manipulation</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559550/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1733400433\" /><i>Various gimmicks</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559550/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1733400433\" /><i>Interference Trap</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Game background</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel freely in a sketch-like background drawn on paper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Classic graphics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Sketch-style background </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Smooth operation</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Crash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559550/ebcfefb67898b6340a46a98a1c26024e16b30ca9.jpg"},{"name":"Ouch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559550/3525349d29700091fd48f74a8055ef29fd716903.jpg"},{"name":"Skyfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559550/3f10ae5b9f59ebcf2fd3b123f3bb40e2fb770d00.jpg"},{"name":"Wrecking Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559550/fd0d509dca2e95d788b9c268fb454100f9f01fb6.jpg"},{"name":"Headache","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559550/61ebce76647fcd27f804cc5ab70d81cb48e88ade.jpg"},{"name":"Shaking Ground","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559550/480d79d0587247d4d83d6b7251d168fa84c737ad.jpg"},{"name":"Wall Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co